+E.6.3 The formal objective (Q20–Q33)
+
+   Q20. What objective does TSHC optimise?
+   30-second answer. At every snapshot and level it greedily minimises J = αS + (1 − α)F + λT . S is
+   the semantic dispersion of MiniLM embeddings, F is native hyperedge fragmentation, and T is the
+   variation of information to the previous snapshot’s partition at the same level. The primary values are
+   α = 0.5 and λ = 0.2.
+   If they push further.
