+  \item \textbf{Data:} 5{,}798 nodes, 1{,}429 hyperedges, 52 papers; arity 2--65, 80.5\% above 2.
+  \item \textbf{Snapshots} (nodes/edges): 2020: 1{,}505/374; 2022: 2{,}164/526; 2024: 4{,}164/983;
+        2026: 5{,}798/1{,}429.
+  \item \textbf{Visibility:} \tcode{first\us seen\us year} $\le t$; an edge needs its year, its
+        article and all endpoints.
+  \item \textbf{Hierarchy:} $P_3$ singletons, $P_2\le120$, $P_1\le40$, $P_0\le12$ (display
+        budgets).
+  \item \textbf{Models:} MiniLM builds; BGE judges coherence and retrieves; DeBERTa NLI checks
+        glosses.
+  \item \textbf{Variants:} semantic ($\alpha=1$), pairwise (projection), static ($\lambda=0$),
+        temporal (primary).
+  \item \textbf{Controls:} 100 type/size-preserving nulls; 10\% deletion, 5 seeds; 70/30 label
+        split; predictions hashed before gold.
+\end{itemize}
+\end{minipage}\hfill
